@model PEMS.Application.DTOs.HelpStandardReferenceAdminEditDto
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@using PEMS.Web.Resources
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> Localizer
@{
    ViewData["HidePageTitle"] = true;
    var isEdit = Model.HelpStandardReferenceId > 0;
    var categories = (IEnumerable<dynamic>)ViewBag.Categories;
    var allArticles = (IEnumerable<dynamic>)ViewBag.AllArticlesForRelated;
    var applicabilityStatuses = new[] { "Applicable", "PotentiallyApplicable", "ContextDependent", "ReferenceOnly", "NotVerified", "NotApplicable" };
    var verificationStatuses = new[] { "OfficialSourceVerified", "PublisherMetadataVerified", "RepositoryMappingVerified", "ExpertReviewRequired", "NotVerified" };
    var implementationStatuses = new[] { "NotImplemented", "PartiallyRelated", "ConceptuallyMapped", "ImplementedButNotComplianceVerified", "ComplianceEvidenceAvailable", "NotApplicable", "NotVerified" };
}

<pems-content-card>
    <h5 class="mb-3"><pems-icon name="bi-journal-bookmark" /> @(isEdit ? "Edit" : "New") Standard Reference</h5>

    @if (!ViewData.ModelState.IsValid)
    {
        <pems-alert tone="danger">
            @foreach (var err in ViewData.ModelState.Values.SelectMany(v => v.Errors))
            {
                <div>@err.ErrorMessage</div>
            }
        </pems-alert>
    }

    <pems-form asp-action="@(isEdit ? "StandardEdit" : "StandardCreate")" asp-route-id="@(isEdit ? Model.HelpStandardReferenceId : (int?)null)" method="post">
        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
        <input type="hidden" asp-for="HelpArticleId" />

        <pems-row gap="3">
            <pems-col md="3">
                <pems-label>Identifier <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="Identifier" required placeholder="e.g. ISO 14224" />
            </pems-col>
            <pems-col md="5">
                <pems-label>Issuing Organization <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="IssuingOrganization" required placeholder="e.g. International Organization for Standardization (ISO)" />
            </pems-col>
            <pems-col md="4">
                <pems-label>Edition / Year</pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="EditionOrYear" placeholder="e.g. 2016" />
            </pems-col>

            <pems-col md="6">
                <pems-label>Official Reference URL</pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="OfficialReferenceUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://www.iso.org/standard/..." />
            </pems-col>
            <pems-col md="6">
                <pems-label>Related Module (free text)</pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="RelatedModule" placeholder="e.g. CMMS / Reliability &amp; Maintenance" />
            </pems-col>

            <pems-col md="4">
                <pems-label>Applicability Status</pems-label>
                <pems-select asp-for="ApplicabilityStatus">
                    @foreach (var s in applicabilityStatuses) { <option value="@s">@s</option> }
                </pems-select>
            </pems-col>
            <pems-col md="4">
                <pems-label>Verification Status</pems-label>
                <pems-select asp-for="VerificationStatus">
                    @foreach (var s in verificationStatuses) { <option value="@s">@s</option> }
                </pems-select>
            </pems-col>
            <pems-col md="4">
                <pems-label>PEMS Implementation Status</pems-label>
                <pems-select asp-for="PEMSImplementationStatus" id="implStatus">
                    @foreach (var s in implementationStatuses) { <option value="@s">@s</option> }
                </pems-select>
                <pems-help-text css="text-danger" id="complianceWarning" hidden>
                    "ComplianceEvidenceAvailable" requires a real Evidence Path below - it must never be used without one.
                </pems-help-text>
            </pems-col>

            <pems-col md="6">
                <pems-label>Evidence Path (repo file/class this mapping is based on)</pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="EvidencePath" placeholder="e.g. PEMS.Domain/Entities/RcmFmea.cs (FMEAItem.RiskPriorityNumber)" />
            </pems-col>
            <pems-col md="6">
                <pems-label>@Localizer["Notes"]</pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="Notes" />
            </pems-col>

            <pems-col md="4">
                <pems-label>Code <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="Code" required placeholder="e.g. standard-iso-14224" />
            </pems-col>
            <pems-col md="4">
                <pems-label>Category <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                <pems-select asp-for="HelpCategoryId" required>
                    @foreach (var c in categories) { <option value="@c.HelpCategoryId">@c.NameEn</option> }
                </pems-select>
            </pems-col>
            <pems-col md="4">
                <pems-label>@Localizer["Display Order"]</pems-label>
                <pems-input asp-for="DisplayOrder" type="number" />
            </pems-col>

            <pems-col span="12">
                <pems-check-row>
                    <pems-input kind="check" asp-for="IsPublished" type="checkbox" />
                    <label asp-for="IsPublished" class="form-check-label">@Localizer["Published (visible to all users)"]</label>
                </pems-check-row>
            </pems-col>

            <pems-col span="12"><hr /></pems-col>

            <pems-col span="12">
                <pems-nav role="tablist">
                    <li class="nav-item"><pems-button tone="bare" css="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-en" type="button">@Localizer["English"]</pems-button></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><pems-button tone="bare" css="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-fa" type="button">@Localizer["فارسی"]</pems-button></li>
                </pems-nav>
                <pems-tab-content css="border border-top-0 p-3">
                    <pems-tab-pane fade="true" active="true" id="tab-en">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <pems-label>Title (EN) <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                            <pems-input asp-for="TitleEn" required />
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <pems-label>Summary / Scope (EN) <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                            <pems-textarea asp-for="SummaryEn" rows="2" required></pems-textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <pems-label>Content (EN, HTML) <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                            <pems-textarea asp-for="ContentEn" rows="10" required></pems-textarea>
                            <pems-help-text>Suggested sections: What it is / Why it matters / PEMS relevance / Current PEMS coverage / Outside current PEMS scope. Never copy official standard text.</pems-help-text>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <pems-label>@Localizer["Search Keywords (EN)"]</pems-label>
                            <pems-input asp-for="SearchKeywordsEn" />
                        </div>
                    </pems-tab-pane>
                    <pems-tab-pane fade="true" id="tab-fa" dir="rtl">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <pems-label>عنوان (فارسی) <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                            <pems-input asp-for="TitleFa" required />
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <pems-label>خلاصه / محدوده (فارسی) <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                            <pems-textarea asp-for="SummaryFa" rows="2" required></pems-textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <pems-label>متن (فارسی، HTML) <span class="text-danger">*</span></pems-label>
                            <pems-textarea asp-for="ContentFa" rows="10" required></pems-textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <pems-label>@Localizer["کلیدواژه‌های جستجو (فارسی)"]</pems-label>
                            <pems-input asp-for="SearchKeywordsFa" />
                        </div>
                    </pems-tab-pane>
                </pems-tab-content>
            </pems-col>

            <pems-col span="12"><hr /></pems-col>

            <pems-col span="12">
                <pems-label>Related Articles (Concepts, Discipline Guides, Page Guides)</pems-label>
                <pems-select name="RelatedArticleIds" multiple size="6">
                    @foreach (var a in allArticles)
                    {
                        var selected = Model.RelatedArticleIds.Contains((int)a.HelpArticleId);
                        <option value="@a.HelpArticleId" selected="@selected">@a.Title (@a.Code)</option>
                    }
                </pems-select>
            </pems-col>
        </pems-row>

        <pems-flex gap="2" css="mt-3">
            <pems-button tone="primary" type="submit">@Localizer["Save"]</pems-button>
            <pems-button as="a" tone="neutral" outline="true" asp-action="StandardMatrix">Back to matrix</pems-button>
        </pems-flex>
    </pems-form>
</pems-content-card>

<script src="~/js/views/admin-help-standardcreate.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
